        "bluffVotes": { "0": 0, "1": 1, "2": 0, "3": 0 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R4-identical-bluffs-merge",
      "desc": "PRD §5.5 + D1: Anne and Cam wrote identical bluffs → one merged option, points split rounding up for each.",
